# ── Personal job-search data (this repo is PUBLIC — keep it out) ──────────────
# The tracker ledger and dashboard inline 267 employer addresses, appointment
# locations and consent URLs whose tokens act on his applications. The scripts
# that build them are tracked; their output never is.
tracker/tracker.json
tracker/dashboard.html
tracker/appointments.json
tracker/actions.json
tracker/preview.png
chains/.lidl-applied.json
email-route/*.json

# CVs carry a home address and mobile number.
cv-de.md
cv-de-*.md

# Profile backups are not covered by the exact-path rule above.
config/profile.yml.*
config/gmail-*.json

